<SAMI>
<HEAD>
<TITLE>Sample</TITLE>
<STYLE TYPE="text/css">
<!--
P { margin-left:8pt; margin-right:8pt; }
.KRCC { Name:Korean; lang:ko-KR; SAMIType:CC; }
.ENCC { Name:English; lang:en-US; SAMIType:CC; }
-->
</STYLE>
</HEAD>
<BODY>
<SYNC Start=1000><P Class=KRCC>안녕하세요! SMI 자막입니다.
<SYNC Start=1000><P Class=ENCC>Hello! This is an SMI subtitle.
<SYNC Start=4000><P Class=KRCC>&nbsp;
<SYNC Start=4500><P Class=KRCC><font color="FFFF00">노란색</font> 글자와<br>두 번째 줄
<SYNC Start=8000><P Class=KRCC>&nbsp;
<SYNC Start=8500><P Class=KRCC>마지막 줄입니다
</BODY>
</SAMI>
